BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230621T065824Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nBe My Guest\nSynopsis\n:\nHear from our colleagues on
	 their experience as a Be My Guest host\, and as a guest. Be inspired to t
	ake on your next Be My Guest opportunity!\nSpeaker\n:\nGrace ZHANG\; Vince
	nt HUA \nFarrah WANG\; Truman ZHENG\nModerator\n:\nCedric CAO\nJoining Ins
	tructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant u
	sing DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Lap
	top.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_
	com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior 
	to the event. This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre
	 for optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on 
	this hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?
	MTID=ebba34ae8cf4954e99a3843031f5d5b75> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last 
	Name\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device
	\n1.	Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\
	nClick on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2515 914 8254\n2.	Input Pas
	sword 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singa
	pore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-M
	umbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2515 9
	14 8254\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.ph
	p?MTID=e1be1d7fb8cf19dadf242f64798d49372> \n \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230721T105000
